{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Smerch Battle Arena",
    "steam_appid": 1213530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213530/extras/a71452e078c7d0fa97406bb4cc700ac2.avif?t=1752204738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Those who go to their deaths salute you!</strong> In the world of gladiators, where every fight is a struggle for survival, the arena becomes a place where blood flows in rivers. Here, in the yellow circle, where there is no place for fear and weakness, gladiators fight for their life and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features modes that allow you to test your strength in battle. In PvP mode, you can face off against other players, where every battle is a struggle for the leading position. In PvE mode you will fight against artificial intelligence to develop your skills and become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213530/extras/a71452e078c7d0fa97406bb4cc700ac2.avif?t=1752204738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Those who go to their deaths salute you!</strong> In the world of gladiators, where every fight is a struggle for survival, the arena becomes a place where blood flows in rivers. Here, in the yellow circle, where there is no place for fear and weakness, gladiators fight for their life and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features modes that allow you to test your strength in battle. In PvP mode, you can face off against other players, where every battle is a struggle for the leading position. In PvE mode you will fight against artificial intelligence to develop your skills and become even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Smerch Battle Arena! This is a fast-paced medieval fighting game where every match decides your fate. Choose your weapon, become a gladiator, and fight for your freedom. Every battle is a survival test, and victory brings valuable rewards.",
